6754173", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_1744578970087506_184867581268551437_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r11_1FTmwXkQ7kNvwFuBuwm&_nc_oc=AdpcyNFgMBWvYq8IUoU_EaU9cmSl31JbqWBfxHZmx87A-bOeq1zJYbAnyLLHYvic__M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNGMKrVgrsH-bhyXDUheOLLKI4rxgoIYEB8tUe68YtOwQ&oe=6ACFA2E0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt3Upscaled.png", "id": "1564248915736562", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_1564248922403228_6762068753518313366_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EuJ7OcGeslMQ7kNvwGOn3NC&_nc_oc=AdpcI9nkCJ1hi9T8qzMP0wmDTiGQJugfehzPsBsmR8Hyf8RgSnE14tgB6l6QYz3S-TA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNTN2PDQiKc59-l4lbxWt0M0rQyFBbZhqPnQwFbOpa35w&oe=6ACF88E1"}, "display_name": "Cookie Puncher", "keywords": ["Cookie", "Punching", "Workout", "Bakery", "Boxing"], "long_description": "Welcome to Cookie Puncher - the only place where smashing cookies is not just allowed\u2026 it\u2019s encouraged.\n\nStep into a  world where your fists are the ultimate baking tool. Punch, crush, fling, and obliterate cookies in wildly satisfying ways. Whether you're going for precision hits or full - on cookie carnage, every swing counts.\n\nBut don't get too comfortable - the Cookie Thief is always looking for a chance to ruin your fun. Stay sharp, keep punching, and prove who's really in charge of the kitchen!\n\n\ud83e\udd4a Features:\n\ud83c\udf6aPunch Cookies - Smash your way through cookies with your own fists.\n\ud83d\udca5Crunchy Feedback - Feel every hit as you pound cookies into pieces.\n\ud83d\uded2Shop & Customize - Unlock new items and customize your experience.\n\ud83e\uddb9\u200d\u2642\ufe0fChallenge the Cookie Thief - Keep an eye out for the thief and take on the challenge.\n\nPunch first. Ask questions later.\n\nThis is stress relief\u2026 but tastier.", "